      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.11,
      "end_seconds": 37.04,
      "duration_seconds": 12.93,
      "text": "it's It's been three weeks I'm fairly sure. My family kept telling me to get it checked. I'm not great at remembering details so bear with me"
