    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 244.72,
      "end_seconds": 248.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "no, I've never been operated on"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.77,
      "end_seconds": 255.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.05,
      "end_seconds": 258.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Uh, no allergies at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.05,
      "end_seconds": 262.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 263.36,
      "end_seconds": 267.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Yes, high blood pressure. I have thin bones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.35,
      "end_seconds": 278.75,
      "duration_seconds": 10.4,
      "text": "Ah. Yes, high blood pressure and thin bones are known to us, good to to have that clear. Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 282.15,
      "end_seconds": 294.13,
      "duration_seconds": 11.98,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.09,
      "end_seconds": 299.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "right, here's what I'm thinking this looks most like an overactive thyroid"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.73,
      "end_seconds": 302.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.78,
      "end_seconds": 311.7,
      "duration_seconds": 7.92,
      "text": "nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like an overactive thyroid, but I'd like to to confirm"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.9,
      "end_seconds": 331.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "I think a thyroid scan makes sense here, for neck swelling"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 333.35,
      "end_seconds": 335.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "erm, that's fine with me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.83,
      "end_seconds": 368.06,
      "duration_seconds": 30.23,
      "text": "I think thyroid blood tests makes sense here, for palpitations and weight loss. For this, propranolol, 20 milligrams, twice a day, until review. You take it by mouth. It's for racing heart and tremor. Try to avoid caffeine while we sort this out. If it hasn't settled next month, we'd think about an ECG, but not now. One warning sign to remember: the symptoms get worse. In that that case don't wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 369.48,
      "end_seconds": 379.06,
      "duration_seconds": 9.58,
      "text": "Please come and see me after the thyroid results. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 380.47,
      "end_seconds": 384.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "mm I think I understand everything thanks"
    },
